From 41cb182978f2fe988f268268ff5758111d89e577 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: William Macready <william.macready@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 19:40:18 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] feat(semantics): prove alias-safe plan step simulation

LayoutOK supplies boundary-local resource injectivity. Init uses the successor layout, accumulation and retirement use the current layout, and all kernels preserve mapped values and unmapped-slot emptiness. Simulation target compiled with only standard axioms; downstream validation remains pending.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
